    "created_at": "2018-02-16T17:24:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-16T17:24:46Z",
    "body": "Note that the +_whatever_ pattern rather than +_knownSuffix_ is absent from any RFCs/standards. I'm not sure that supporting it generically is something we want to do, even if it might makes sense to support application/json+protobuf due to existing usage.",
