    "updated_at": "2018-02-16T18:48:14Z",
    "body": "In whatwg/html#3455 we moved the definition of JSON MIME type to https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#mime-type-groups with all the other MIME type groups. But, I don't see a need to move the issue, unless people find its location confusing.",
